From 5e523e64957ba0f2340ee3f51ff19450cf21010e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thinkthoughts <dth26b@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:22:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] A3c: Lemma 7.10 complete, all 455 packing roots
 kernel-checked

Extends the A3b certificate checker with load-hyperplane cuts over profile
and box coordinates, certified empty cells (exact Farkas infeasibility,
emptyB_sound), and piecewise kernel checking (checkTree2_split_path).
Proves the 43 condition-(D) roots left open by A3b (1601 leaves, 454
kernel pieces) and states Lemma 7.10 for every condition and all
1 <= m <= m' <= 13. A3a/A3b files are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DyEq5SJg3P8RhuwC4Kgon8
